---
import ProjectLayout from '../../layouts/ProjectLayout.astro';
import Media from '../../components/Media.astro';
---

<ProjectLayout
  title="Project Erwin"
  subtitle="An AI secretary that runs your day from voice, Obsidian, and a cloned command voice"
  tags={[
    { label: "Voice AI", href: "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Speech_synthesis" },
    { label: "Obsidian", href: "https://obsidian.md" },
    { label: "Piper TTS", href: "https://github.com/rhasspy/piper" },
    { label: "Telegram", href: "https://telegram.org" },
  ]}
>
  <section class="story-section">
    <h2>The Goal</h2>
    <p>
      Erwin is meant to be an AI secretary: it figures out your schedule, issues reminders and
      commands from what you tell it, and makes task logging low-friction. Logging work should
      not become its own productivity tax. The voice is Commander Erwin from Attack on Titan;
      the agent has access to whatever personal data you choose to give it.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="story-section">
    <h2>How It Runs</h2>
    <p>
      Day-to-day context lives in an Obsidian vault (everything except high-sensitivity secrets
      like SSNs). The agent reads that vault to manage schedule and decide what to surface next,
      cutting the friction of "what should I do right now?"
    </p>
    <p>
      The intended voice path is ElevenLabs for dataset creation, then local Piper (or
      GPT-SoVITS) so replies run without a cloud TTS bill. Weights are not trained yet;
      the pipelines are in place for that. The local node talks over Telegram (text + voice
      notes) and handles deadline-aware reminders as a long-running service.
    </p>
    <p>
      The former Jarvis runtime, jarvis-backend Piper fine-tune track, and Erwin AI Voice Weights
      GPT-SoVITS pipeline now live in one Project Erwin repo: Telegram node at the root,
      <code>voice/piper-finetune/</code>, and <code>voice/gptsovits/</code>.
    </p>

    <Media
      src="/assets/projects/erwin/telegram-thread.png"
      alt="Telegram conversation with Erwin"
      caption="Sample Telegram thread: schedule query, reminder set, and voice reply"
      aspect="auto"
    />
    <Media
      src="/assets/projects/erwin/obsidian-context.png"
      alt="Obsidian vault context for Erwin"
      caption="Vault notes the agent uses for scheduling and priorities (personal paths blurred)"
      aspect="16/9"
    />
    <Media
      src="/assets/projects/erwin/voice-sample.mp3"
      alt="Erwin voice reminder sample"
      caption="Piper TTS voice sample: deep-work reminder"
      type="audio"
    />
  </section>

  <section class="story-section">
    <h2>Status</h2>
    <p>
      Telegram + local TTS path works. Fine-tune / clone pipelines live under
      <code>voice/</code>; Erwin-specific weights are still the next step, not shipped.
      Portfolio media on this page is the current evidence of the product surface.
    </p>
  </section>
</ProjectLayout>
